@baseUrl = http://localhost:8090

### Search drugs nationally
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/drugs?query=paracitamol

### Search drugs near the test pharmacy location
### Test pharmacy POINT(11.5134 3.8893) -> latitude=3.8893, longitude=11.5134
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/drugs?query=paracetamol&latitude=3.8893&longitude=11.5134

### Search drugs near the test pharmacy location with an explicit radius
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/drugs?query=paracetamol&latitude=3.8893&longitude=11.5134&radiusKm=20

### Search drugs with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/drugs?query=paracetamol&page=0&size=10
